sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Owner
  participant C as OCC
  participant S as Trusted sender
  participant R as Original work owner
  O->>C: Withdraw access
  C-->>O: Withdrawal committed
  S->>C: Check next operation
  C-->>S: Deny removed access
  Note over C,S: Unavailable authority also refuses use
  Note over C,R: Accepted race: a final check can race withdrawal#59;<br/>send may start after acknowledgment
  Note over S,R: Original deadline still applies<br/>Cancellation is best effort<br/>Timeout does not undo effects
  S->>R: Preserve uncertain send and attempt evidence
  Note over C,R: Send, refresh and clone keep their original owner,<br/>deadline and cleanup duties across process replacement
  R->>R: Reconcile provider effect<br/>or require reauthorization
  Note over S,R: No blind replay<br/>Preserve late outcomes<br/>Cleanup remains owed
  R-->>C: Resolved or still-pending evidence
  C-->>O: Status and outstanding cleanup
